cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use orchid-clip in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "orchid-clip: a BioCLIP 2 fine-tune for orchid identification"
abstract: >-
  Inference, evaluation and calibration code and figure generators for
  orchid-clip-v8, BioCLIP 2 (ViT-L/14) fine-tuned on orchid (Orchidaceae)
  photographs with a sampler that up-weights rare species. The weights are on
  the Hugging Face Hub.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arnold
    given-names: Jaret
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-4055-5238"
repository-code: "https://github.com/musharna/orchid-clip"
url: "https://huggingface.co/musharna/orchid-clip-v8"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - orchids
  - Orchidaceae
  - plant-identification
  - computer-vision
  - clip
  - bioclip
